codex
The right operand transpose itself is not copied today; cuBLAS sees a transposed stride. Local tests show a pre-transposed contiguous right operand is faster for `N=256/512/768` and slower for `N=1024`. I’m going to store `right` in transposed layout for the smaller sequence cases and switch BMM accordingly.
